{"id":"jbrn92qdzccvs9kpqrjgx7qls","title":"耐克公布五年复苏计划：2029财年争取重回行业增速","originalTitle":null,"summary":"耐克发布五年复苏计划，目标2031财年营业利润率达12%-14%，通过成本削减、产品创新及重点市场调整实现。大中华区收入2026财年同比下降11%，2027Q1再降26%，计划收缩线上分销、合并亚太市场，并返还股东120亿美元。","reason":"耐克五年计划明确成本削减、产品创新及重点市场调整路径，计划2031财年营业利润率达12%-14%。","source":{"name":"华尔街见闻"},"links":{"original":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3786121"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T19:54:18.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T20:01:41.281Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T20:01:41.281Z","category":null,"tags":["财报"],"score":82,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"c10713e5-a801-4ebd-b2f0-db622c09bb44","title":"耐克发布五年战略：目标增收50亿美元并返还股东120亿美元"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"c10713e5-a801-4ebd-b2f0-db622c09bb44","title":"耐克发布五年战略：目标增收50亿美元并返还股东120亿美元"}],"topics":[{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fk1cw7u4vGTs","reportCount":2,"additionalSourceCount":1},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}